%% M3 — request-lifecycle: one prompt's journey through the gate
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as curl
    participant NGF as NGINX Gateway Fabric (edge)
    participant G as Nova gate
    participant N as NOVA evaluators
    participant L as Laya (decision model)
    participant S as llm-sim (pool)

    C->>NGF: POST /v1/completions
    NGF->>G: HTTPRoute → backendRef
    G->>N: scan prompt (.nov rules)
    N-->>G: keyword <1ms · semantic ~15ms
    alt NOVA rule matches
        G--xC: 403 (fail closed) — pool never sees it
    else no rule match
        G->>L: typed questions (choice + boolean)
        L-->>G: verdict + calibrated probability
        alt verdict ≠ benign
            G--xC: 403 (Laya block)
        else benign
            G->>S: forward completion request
            S-->>G: 200 completion
            G-->>C: 200 + X-AI-Verdict header
        end
    end
